# 16 -- mixed weight mode: LS-fit + pinned + OPTIM'd linear coefficients.
#
# The training config (local config.tadah) pins weights 13 and 14 via
# FIXINDEX/FIXWEIGHT. Weight 13 stays at its pinned value for the whole
# run; weight 14 is searched by the optimiser below; weights 1-12 are
# least-squares refitted against the residual target on every evaluation.
#
# NOTE: OPTIM FIXWEIGHT indices name MODEL WEIGHTS (the values FIXINDEX
# pins), not positions in the FIXWEIGHT list -- `(14)` means weight 14.
# With FIXINDEX present, analytical/HYBRID gradients fall back to finite
# differences; a derivative-free algorithm is the natural choice.

OPTIMIZER
  STRATEGY
    TYPE PLAIN
    LIB NLOPT
    ALGO LN_BOBYQA
    MAXEVAL 30
  ENDSTRATEGY
ENDOPTIMIZER

LOSS L2
FAILSCORE 1e16
PC_ERMSE 0 0.0001
PC_LAMMPS --script ../common/lammps/Ecoh.in --hotvar hot_a0 2.5 4.5 3.302 --varloss Ecoh 8.10 800

OPTIM FIXWEIGHT (14) -50.0 50.0

OUTPUT 1
BOUTPUT 1
